1. Compile: run build.sh to generate executable at build/bin directory. 
   ./build.sh

2. Go to radar.fd to simulate reflectivity from nature run(NR)
   a) Horizontally interpolate NR to MRMS lat-lon grid and generate geopotential height and reflectivity fields separately.
      ./run_nr2mrmsGrid.sh 

   b) Vertically interpolate NR to MRMS levels and apply radar mask.
      ./run_process_NSSL_mosaic.sh
      
